    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE IN THE DARKNESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It Consumes is an FPS survivors game that plays like a combination of Devil Daggers and Vampire Survivors, but with an additional twist \u2014 to see you must use your\u00a0<i>pulse</i>\u00a0to temporarily reveal your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371060/extras/c975dd41e8b43d373a6b0e66146d455e.poster.avif?t=1752734523\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371060/extras/c975dd41e8b43d373a6b0e66146d455e.webm?t=1752734523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371060/extras/c975dd41e8b43d373a6b0e66146d455e.mp4?t=1752734523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY RUN IS UNIQUE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain new abilities, upgrade your firepower and mobility, and become an unstoppable demon slaying machine. Different upgrades reward different styles of play, so there's always new strategies to try out when you start a new run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371060/extras/55d973a684711f12c3499309637e7452.poster.avif?t=1752734523\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371060/extras/55d973a684711f12c3499309637e7452.webm?t=1752734523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371060/extras/55d973a684711f12c3499309637e7452.mp4?t=1752734523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Customize your build.</u></strong> Equip your favourite weapons and abilities, and unlock dozens of perks. Mix and match them to create your perfect playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Extensive difficulty modifier system</u></strong><u>.</u> Unlock dozens of modifiers that add new challenge and change the way you play. From basics like adding more enemies or increasing their health, to more unique effects like \u2018<i>you can only move by dodging</i>.\u2019</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Meaningful rewards.</strong></u> Completing runs at higher difficulties unlocks powerful special abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Unique challenge runs.</u></strong> Extra challenges that bend the rules. Can you survive hundreds of enemies if you're given infinite ammo? How long can you survive without shooting? How about a run where you can't attack unless you're standing still?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Custom games</u>.</strong> Break the game entirely by designing your own custom game mode. Adjust almost value (such as damage, ammo capacity, movement speed, etc.) and toggle on or off any combination of player upgrades. Change pretty much anything you want, and export your custom games to share with other players!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371060/extras/5fbfbda69bce715b558dac76857cbd12.poster.avif?t=1752734523\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371060/extras/5fbfbda69bce715b558dac76857cbd12.webm?t=1752734523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371060/extras/5fbfbda69bce715b558dac76857cbd12.mp4?t=1752734523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE IN THE DARKNESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It Consumes is an FPS survivors game that plays like a combination of Devil Daggers and Vampire Survivors, but with an additional twist \u2014 to see you must use your\u00a0<i>pulse</i>\u00a0to temporarily reveal your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371060/extras/c975dd41e8b43d373a6b0e66146d455e.poster.avif?t=1752734523\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371060/extras/c975dd41e8b43d373a6b0e66146d455e.webm?t=1752734523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371060/extras/c975dd41e8b43d373a6b0e66146d455e.mp4?t=1752734523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY RUN IS UNIQUE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain new abilities, upgrade your firepower and mobility, and become an unstoppable demon slaying machine. Different upgrades reward different styles of play, so there's always new strategies to try out when you start a new run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371060/extras/55d973a684711f12c3499309637e7452.poster.avif?t=1752734523\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371060/extras/55d973a684711f12c3499309637e7452.webm?t=1752734523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371060/extras/55d973a684711f12c3499309637e7452.mp4?t=1752734523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Customize your build.</u></strong> Equip your favourite weapons and abilities, and unlock dozens of perks. Mix and match them to create your perfect playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Extensive difficulty modifier system</u></strong><u>.</u> Unlock dozens of modifiers that add new challenge and change the way you play. From basics like adding more enemies or increasing their health, to more unique effects like \u2018<i>you can only move by dodging</i>.\u2019</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Meaningful rewards.</strong></u> Completing runs at higher difficulties unlocks powerful special abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Unique challenge runs.</u></strong> Extra challenges that bend the rules. Can you survive hundreds of enemies if you're given infinite ammo? How long can you survive without shooting? How about a run where you can't attack unless you're standing still?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Custom games</u>.</strong> Break the game entirely by designing your own custom game mode. Adjust almost value (such as damage, ammo capacity, movement speed, etc.) and toggle on or off any combination of player upgrades. Change pretty much anything you want, and export your custom games to share with other players!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371060/extras/5fbfbda69bce715b558dac76857cbd12.poster.avif?t=1752734523\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371060/extras/5fbfbda69bce715b558dac76857cbd12.webm?t=1752734523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371060/extras/5fbfbda69bce715b558dac76857cbd12.mp4?t=1752734523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
